Description: ARGUS.EXE — antivirus & malware detector (Linux edition)
 Sentinel Safeguard LLC's antivirus for Debian-based systems
 (Kali Linux, Parrot OS, Debian, Ubuntu): real-time folder
 protection by a systemd service, signature + heuristic +
 behaviour-rule scanning, an encrypted quarantine vault, and a
 desktop window for scans, decisions and reports.
 .
 The protection service verifies every privileged action request
 over a Unix socket using the kernel's own record of who is
 asking (SO_PEERCRED) plus the installed program's recorded
 SHA-256 fingerprint — the Linux twin of the Windows edition's
 verified named pipe.
